# Test dependencies, exact pins rather than `>=` floors.
#
# A floor resolves to whatever is newest on PyPI when the venv is built, which
# puts the seven day `minimumReleaseAge` in .github/renovate.json5 out of the
# loop entirely: that window governs when Renovate proposes a change, not
# what pip installs at build time. Same reasoning as
# ivan-pinatti-labs/docker-torrent-box-with-vpn's tests/requirements.txt.
#
# tests/requirements.txt is compiled from this file with hashes; regenerate it
# with the command in its header (see docs/CONTRIBUTING.md), never edit it by
# hand. pyyaml is the runtime dependency the tests exercise through
# check_disk_usage, pinned here too so the suite installs from this one lock;
# keep it equal to the root requirements.in. coverage measures the suite for
# SonarQube Cloud (`make coverage`).
coverage==7.16.2
pytest==9.1.1
pyyaml==6.0.3
